<!--
Upload as: Template:Infobox item
Usage:
{{Infobox item
| name       = Iron Ingot
| image      = Iron_Ingot_icon.png
| type       = Resource
| slot       = Backpack
| stack      = 20
| weight     = 2.5
| source     = Smelted from [[Iron Ore]]
| workbench  = [[Furnace]]
| tags       = metal, ingot
}}
-->
<includeonly><div class="portable-infobox pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default">
<h2 class="pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title">{{{name|{{PAGENAME}}}}}</h2>
{{#if:{{{image|}}}|<figure class="pi-item pi-image">[[File:{{{image}}}|300px|center|alt={{{alt|Icon of {{{name|{{PAGENAME}}}}}}}}]]{{#if:{{{caption|}}}|<figcaption>{{{caption}}}</figcaption>}}</figure>}}
<section class="pi-item pi-group">
{{#if:{{{type|}}}|<div class="pi-item pi-data"><h3 class="pi-data-label">Type</h3><div class="pi-data-value">{{{type}}}</div></div>}}
{{#if:{{{slot|}}}|<div class="pi-item pi-data"><h3 class="pi-data-label">Slot</h3><div class="pi-data-value">{{{slot}}}</div></div>}}
{{#if:{{{stack|}}}|<div class="pi-item pi-data"><h3 class="pi-data-label">Max stack</h3><div class="pi-data-value">{{{stack}}}</div></div>}}
{{#if:{{{weight|}}}|<div class="pi-item pi-data"><h3 class="pi-data-label">Weight</h3><div class="pi-data-value">{{{weight}}}</div></div>}}
{{#if:{{{source|}}}|<div class="pi-item pi-data"><h3 class="pi-data-label">Source</h3><div class="pi-data-value">{{{source}}}</div></div>}}
{{#if:{{{workbench|}}}|<div class="pi-item pi-data"><h3 class="pi-data-label">Workbench</h3><div class="pi-data-value">{{{workbench}}}</div></div>}}
{{#if:{{{tags|}}}|<div class="pi-item pi-data"><h3 class="pi-data-label">Tags</h3><div class="pi-data-value">{{{tags}}}</div></div>}}
</section>
</div></includeonly><noinclude>
== Usage ==
Generic infobox for any inventory item that isn't a weapon, vehicle part, or perk. See [[Template:Infobox weapon]] for weapons.

<pre>
{{Infobox item
| name       =
| image      =
| alt        =   (accessibility: describe the image for screen readers; defaults to "Icon of <name>")
| caption    =   (optional; must add context, not repeat alt text)
| type       = Resource | Equipment | Food | Water | Ammo
| slot       = Hand_R | Hand_L | Equip | Ammo | GunAttach
| stack      =
| weight     =
| source     =
| workbench  =
| tags       =
}}
</pre>

'''Accessibility:''' every field defaults are used when omitted; leave empty rather than filling with a placeholder like "N/A" so the row is hidden. Always provide '''alt''' text for informative images (see [[Human host Wiki:Accessibility checklist]]).

